{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecomposition","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecomposition","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecomposition","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/PerNucleonChannelDecomposition.lean#L41-L52","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript):\n\nThe Garside matrix element for a nucleus of mass number $A$\nfactors as a product of **per-nucleon contributions**, each\ndecomposed into four channels by the $T_{2,3}$ eigenstructure\nof $H_3(q)$.\n\n    The Lean encoding below states the manuscript claim over a context class and discharges it from the class's fields (§3b-conditional). The declaration type-checks as a complete term; the substantive mathematical content is carried by the context-class axioms, and a full derivation from substrate primitives remains pending. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:per-nucleon-channel-decomposition","label":"def:per-nucleon-channel-decomposition","md":"quantum-observable-universe/nuclear-interactions/per-nucleon-channel-decomposition.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.h_prod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.h_prod","kind":"theorem","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/PerNucleonChannelDecomposition.lean#L39-L39","doc":"The product of per-nucleon contributions equals the intermediate product. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.h_M","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.h_M","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/PerNucleonChannelDecomposition.lean#L37-L37","doc":"The Garside element equals the intermediate product. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.intermediate_prod","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.intermediate_prod","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/PerNucleonChannelDecomposition.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Intermediate Garside-product value. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.M_m","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.M_m","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/PerNucleonChannelDecomposition.lean#L33-L33","doc":"The per-nucleon contributions `M_m : Fin A → ℝ` (four-channel\ndecomposed). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.M","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.M","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/PerNucleonChannelDecomposition.lean#L30-L30","doc":"The Garside element of the nucleus. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.A_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.A_eq","kind":"theorem","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/PerNucleonChannelDecomposition.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.A","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.A","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/PerNucleonChannelDecomposition.lean#L27-L27","doc":"Mass number `A = Z + N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.N","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/PerNucleonChannelDecomposition.lean#L25-L25","doc":"Neutron number `N`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.Z","kind":"def","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/PerNucleonChannelDecomposition.lean#L23-L23","doc":"Proton number `Z`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.PerNucleonChannelDecompositionContext.mk"